---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Embodied Music Pedagogy" path="/">
  <div class="welcome">
    <p>Welcome to our website,</p>
    <p>dedicated to our work on</p>
    <p><a class="blue" href="/about">Embodied Music Pedagogy</a>!</p>
    <p>&nbsp;</p>
    <p>Melissa Bremmer &amp; Luc Nijs</p>
  </div>
  <img class="welcome-photo" src="/images/luc-melissa.jpg" alt="Luc Nijs and Melissa Bremmer" />
  <section class="news">
    <h4>News</h4>
    <p class="n1">Our special Cultuur+Educatie special issue (in dutch) on Embodied learning and teaching in Arts Education is out! see <a class="line" href="https://www.ahk.nl/media/ahk/docs/lectoraat/CE_68_De_kracht_van_belichaamd_leren_en_doceren_in_kunsteducatie_DT.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a></p>
    <p class="n2">2024, fall: new book coming out (in Dutch): "Bewegend leren musiceren. Een kinemuzikale benadering van het instrumentaal muziekonderwijs", uitgegeven bij Garant</p>
    <p>see <a class="line" href="https://www.maklugarant.eu/nl/products/details/bewegend-leren-musiceren-een-kinemuzikale-benadering-van-het-instrumentaal-muziekonderwijs-luc-nijs-9789044139334-457631" target="_blank" rel="noopener">here</a></p>
    <img class="news-cover" src="/images/book-cover.jpg" alt="Book cover: Bewegend leren musiceren" />
  </section>
</Base>
